Pantheon White Paper

Lithographic Tattoos

Executable Human Artifacts

Abstract

A QR code stores data.

A lithographic tattoo stores an operator.

The objective is not merely to link to a webpage but to create a durable, human-readable, machine-readable artifact that can serve as a reconstruction seed across biological, digital, and cultural media.

